#, no-wrap
msgid "Known Gaps (Documentation ≠ Fully Implemented)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/security.md:90
msgid ""
"The following are planned in code or docs—**deployers must not assume "
"implemented**:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/security.md:102
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Priority | Item                                              | Status                                               |\n"
"| -------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| P0       | `file_*` path deny (`/etc/`, vault, ssh, …)       | **Implemented** (`path-policy`)                      |\n"
"| P0       | `terminal_run` default `shell=false`              | **Implemented**                                      |\n"
"| P0       | Terminal catastrophic command hard deny           | **Implemented** (heuristic; ≠ sandbox)               |\n"
"| P0       | `code_execute` no shell                           | **Implemented** (JS FS still open)                   |\n"
"| P1       | Runtime Unix socket `chmod 600` + handshake token | Not implemented                                      |\n"
"| P1       | `FREEANIMA_WRITE_SAFE_ROOT` / `READ_SAFE_ROOT`    | Not implemented                                      |\n"
"| P2       | (retired) Config API field redaction maintenance  | Dropped — secrets not masked (incl. MCP env/headers) |\n"
"| P3       | IPC / LLM rate limiting                           | None                                                 |\n"
"| P3       | Session disk encryption                           | None                                                 |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/security.md:103
#, no-wrap
msgid "Threat Sources"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/security.md:112
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Code  | Name                | Description                                                      |\n"
"| ----- | ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **A** | External attack     | Unauthorized access, port exposure                               |\n"
"| **B** | LLM-layer injection | Prompt injection, tool parameter manipulation, command injection |\n"
"| **C** | Agent error         | Mistaken dangerous operations                                    |\n"
"| **D** | Dependency chain    | Third-party lib / MCP / ACP compromise                           |\n"
"| **E** | Data security       | Conversation leak, key leak, memory tampering                    |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/security.md:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "Security Matrix"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/security.md:123
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Module             | A External                                                 | B LLM injection                                                     | C Agent error             | D Dependencies     | E Data                             |\n"
"| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Runtime**        | Default 127.0.0.1 bind                                     | MaxTurnsExceeded                                                    | Gap: rate limiting        | llm client vulns   | PG unencrypted                     |\n"
"| **Gateway**        | Token in Vault / env                                       | Malicious messages                                                  | Reply with sensitive info | SDK vulns          | —                                  |\n"
"| **CLI / Tools**    | Local shell compromised                                    | path deny + terminal hard deny (bypass via `code_execute` possible) | Reduced catastrophic rm   | —                  | Logs may contain conversations     |\n"
"| **HTTP / Habitat** | `service_api_tokens` Bearer token（所有来源，含 loopback） | BFF does not touch LLM params directly                              | config display            | Vue/axios          | SSE plaintext                      |\n"
"| **MCP / ACP**      | SSE auth undefined                                         | Malicious params                                                    | Wrong delegation          | Server compromised | Context may contain sensitive data |\n"
"| **Vault**          | Agent machine key file permissions                         | Metadata-only tools; per-call `secrets[]` / `browser_type` `secret` | Wrong item / env_name     | Web Crypto         | User MP never in PG messages       |\n"
msgstr ""

